 from `src/index.ts`.
 
 Run its tests with `npm test`.
+
+Every task carries `createdAt` and `updatedAt`, ISO-8601 date-times. They are equal when the task is
+added; completing, reopening, renaming, tagging or untagging it (when that really changes it) sets
+`updatedAt` to the time of the change. The domain never reads the clock: `createTodoList(now?)` takes a
+clock, defaulting to the current time, so tests can pass a fixed one.
